1
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:15,700
You're here.

2
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:18,730
My lord, you're accustomed to fine clothes and food.

3
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:21,030
This prison fare must be hard to swallow.

4
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,300
I wonder whether, back then, my father in prison

5
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,670
ate the same food.

6
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,570
As expected, all these years,

7
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:28,930
you've known the truth all along.

8
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:31,170
The evidence that framed my father for treason

9
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,870
was submitted to His Majesty by you.

10
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,770
Surely you haven't forgotten.

11
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:37,400
The Shan family was wiped out.

12
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,400
Now my entire Chen family is to be executed too.

13
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,600
What more do you want?

14
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,530
Wei Su is attacking Gubeikou.

15
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,600
He'll reach the gates of Shunjing within three days.

16
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,770
I'll use the Yulin Border Cavalry to clear the Shan family's name.

17
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,600
I can't believe you still don't know

18
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,430
who really killed Shan Muchuan.

19
00:01:01,430 --> 00:01:02,970
Foolish child. What a fool.

20
00:01:04,170 --> 00:01:05,000
What do you mean?

21
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,770
The Empress is also a member of the Shan family.

22
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:09,370
The Yulin Border Cavalry can defend that dragon throne,

23
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:11,700
and they can overthrow it too.

24
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,430
Whether the emperor stays or falls lies with the Shan family.

25
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:16,100
Nonsense! Shut up!

26
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
I don't believe you.

27
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,900
I don't believe you.

28
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,530
Do you think

29
00:01:22,530 --> 00:01:24,530
he truly knew nothing?

30
00:01:24,670 --> 00:01:26,870
Every memorial from the Directorate of Ceremonial

31
00:01:27,130 --> 00:01:29,500
was personally approved by the Emperor.

32
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:33,500
Impossible.

33
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,900
His Majesty and my father were like brothers.

34
00:01:36,370 --> 00:01:37,630
He even married my aunt.

35
00:01:39,729 --> 00:01:41,170
Chu Mingke.

36
00:01:42,729 --> 00:01:46,300
You're laughably naive.

37
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:58,700
My lord!

38
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:00,570
My lord!

39
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:02,200
You absolutely mustn't!

40
00:02:04,030 --> 00:02:05,200
Eighteen years ago...

41
00:02:05,970 --> 00:02:07,600
Where?

42
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:57,730
Helian Zhao! Come out!

43
00:03:07,570 --> 00:03:08,500
Why are you crying?

44
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:10,300
Your puppy isn't here.

45
00:03:10,730 --> 00:03:12,130
Are you that upset, my lord?

46
00:03:13,530 --> 00:03:15,300
Why do you keep staring at me like that?

47
00:03:15,900 --> 00:03:17,930
Is it because I resemble His Majesty

48
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:20,000
or your aunt?

49
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:24,230
You know everything?

50
00:03:27,130 --> 00:03:29,000
Would you like to come closer and take another look, my lord?

51
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,270
Get out.

52
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:35,370
I let you escape.

53
00:03:37,829 --> 00:03:38,370
Where else

54
00:03:38,370 --> 00:03:39,770
could be better than by your side?

55
00:03:44,970 --> 00:03:45,800
Don't send me away again.

56
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,600
My lord.

57
00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:48,800
I'm your little dog.

58
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:04,830
Who are you going to kill?

59
00:04:07,030 --> 00:04:08,170
None of your business.

60
00:04:08,670 --> 00:04:11,500
Tell me. I'll kill him for you.

61
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,700
What makes you think you can help me?

62
00:04:19,029 --> 00:04:19,970
Because Shunjing still isn't

63
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,630
completely under your control.

64
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:23,970
What did you—

65
00:04:25,570 --> 00:04:27,370
I know you want Prince Yu to become Crown Prince.

66
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,430
As long as you want it,

67
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,500
I can lay the whole realm at your feet.

68
00:04:34,570 --> 00:04:35,500
What do you want?

69
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:39,800
I want Helian Zhen's head

70
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,630
to avenge my father.

71
00:04:43,900 --> 00:04:44,830
Is that all?

72
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:46,970
I want you too.

73
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:50,800
Don't abandon me.

74
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:10,870
Don't you love me?

75
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:15,270
Wouldn't it be nice to die together?

76
00:05:23,030 --> 00:05:24,430
You're too late.

77
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:25,870
He can't be saved.

78
00:05:26,900 --> 00:05:28,030
Your Highness, this jade pendant...

79
00:05:28,900 --> 00:05:30,170
I happen to have one too.

80
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:40,000
How did it end up in your hands?

81
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,230
Wasn't he supposed to...

82
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,630
I see.

83
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,800
You're Bilig's son.

84
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:49,430
He gave me this jade pendant.

85
00:05:50,570 --> 00:05:52,830
He said he'd take me home.

86
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:55,570
I waited here for him for twenty-six years.

87
00:05:55,570 --> 00:05:57,570
But he had long forgotten me.

88
00:05:58,530 --> 00:05:59,500
He never forgot.

89
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:03,270
Even on his deathbed, he remembered he had to take you home.

90
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,900
I'm Father's adopted son.

91
00:06:06,730 --> 00:06:08,230
He never married in his life.

92
00:06:09,900 --> 00:06:11,900
Father spent his whole life fighting on the battlefield,

93
00:06:12,970 --> 00:06:15,270
only to earn enough military merit to bring you back.

94
00:06:21,930 --> 00:06:23,930
Your Highness still doesn't know who I am, do you?

95
00:06:25,330 --> 00:06:27,100
You are...

96
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:30,800
Helian Zhao

97
00:06:30,970 --> 00:06:33,570
is the Second Prince you sent out of the palace years ago.

98
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,030
But wasn't that child...

99
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:39,000
How could there be such a coincidence?

100
00:06:41,730 --> 00:06:44,070
Retribution... This is all retribution.

101
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:46,070
Enough.

102
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,570
This is all my life will ever be.

103
00:06:48,830 --> 00:06:49,930
In the next life...

104
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:05,370
Commander, they're all dead.

105
00:07:05,370 --> 00:07:05,770
Good.

106
00:07:10,470 --> 00:07:11,900
Heng'er...

107
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:14,470
Chu Heng is already dead.

108
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:23,670
Your Majesty...

109
00:07:24,570 --> 00:07:26,070
has passed away.

110
00:07:29,230 --> 00:07:30,530
Your Majesty!

111
00:07:32,030 --> 00:07:34,300
By mandate of Heaven, the Emperor decrees:

112
00:07:34,370 --> 00:07:35,500
Prince Yu is benevolent and devoted to the realm.

113
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,030
He is fit to inherit the throne.

114
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:38,470
I hereby pass the throne to Prince Yu.

115
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:40,070
All ministers shall assist him with utmost loyalty.

116
00:07:40,370 --> 00:07:42,330
In the past, treacherous officials falsely persecuted the Shan family.

117
00:07:42,330 --> 00:07:44,130
The new emperor is hereby ordered to overturn the verdict and clear their name,

118
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,270
and honor their loyalty after death.

119
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,370
May the new emperor learn from my past mistakes,

120
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:48,500
keep worthy men close and sycophants at a distance,

121
00:07:48,670 --> 00:07:49,670
and safeguard Great Chu.

122
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:50,600
So decreed.

123
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:03,100
The market at Yanmen Pass is quite lively.

124
00:08:03,270 --> 00:08:04,300
Mastiffs for sale!

125
00:08:11,030 --> 00:08:11,900
How much is this one?

126
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,470
One hundred wen each.

127
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:14,930
They're all purebred mastiffs.

128
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:19,970
Here. Pay him.

129
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:29,700
No. Pick another one.

130
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:30,570
That's a wolf.

131
00:08:32,130 --> 00:08:32,929
Sir.

132
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:34,500
We'll take it.

133
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:36,100
Excellent! You have a decisive eye, sir.

134
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:54,630
Why buy a wolf?

135
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:02,500
To raise it. What's wrong?

136
00:09:03,970 --> 00:09:06,100
You already have me, and you're still keeping it?

137
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:10,500
How petty.

138
00:09:11,170 --> 00:09:11,900
You're jealous of a wolf?

139
00:09:12,430 --> 00:09:13,400
Of course I am.

140
00:09:13,730 --> 00:09:14,870
I'm dying of jealousy.

141
00:09:17,430 --> 00:09:18,170
This wolf pup

142
00:09:18,170 --> 00:09:19,600
looks like it's up to no good.

143
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:21,500
Give it to me. I'll hold it.

144
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:23,070
Nonsense.

145
00:09:23,370 --> 00:09:24,370
How can a wolf be up to no good?

146
00:09:24,430 --> 00:09:26,170
Look at it baring its teeth.

147
00:09:26,570 --> 00:09:27,370
It looks untrustworthy.

148
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:35,430
How many years does it take to tame a wolf?

149
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:37,100
I don't know.

150
00:09:37,830 --> 00:09:39,630
Ten years? Twenty?

151
00:09:40,530 --> 00:09:42,870
Or thirty? Forty?

152
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:45,530
Thirty years is fine.

153
00:09:45,830 --> 00:09:46,970
Forty years is fine too.

154
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,600
No matter how many years,

155
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:51,670
the Yulin Border Cavalry will always remain here.

156
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:54,700
While the Great Wall stands, we live.

157
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:57,000
If the Great Wall falls, we die.

158
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,200
All right.

159
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:00,330
No matter how many years,

160
00:10:01,070 --> 00:10:02,330
I'll stay with you.
